<title>CANADA: Alcan Q3 shr net turns to profit.</title>
<headline>Alcan Q3 shr net turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit     US$0.43     loss     US$0.63</p>
<p> Net	 profit	97,000     loss     142,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,881,000		2,288,000</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit     US$1.43   profit     US$0.89</p>
<p> Net	 profit     324,000   profit     200,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,868,000		7,192,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: 1995 results included a write-down of US$420 million after the company wrote down its investment in Kemano Completion Project in September 1995. Full name is Alcan Aluminium Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
